PackageIdentifier: OndeInference.onde-code
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: OndeInference
PublisherUrl: https://ondeinference.com/
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/@REPO@/issues
PackageName: Onde Code
PackageUrl: https://github.com/@REPO@
License: Apache-2.0
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/@REPO@/blob/main/LICENSE
ShortDescription: Onde Code is Onde Inference's ACP-compatible coding agent for model fine-tuning and deployment.
Description: |-
  Onde Code is an ACP-compatible local-first AI coding agent backed by Onde Inference.
  It runs LLM inference on-device via GGUF models or against any OpenAI-compatible
  endpoint, and integrates with editors such as Zed and VS Code via the Agent Client
  Protocol (ACP).
Moniker: onde-code
